<section id="A1.SS9" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.9 </span>Prompts</h3>

<figure id="none0.prompt1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_prompt ltx_framed ltx_framed_top"><span id="none0.prompt1.3" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_center ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom">
<span id="none0.prompt1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="none0.prompt1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="none0.prompt1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Given this reward code: {reward_code} 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span>
<span id="none0.prompt1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="none0.prompt1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="none0.prompt1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Trajectory:<span id="none0.prompt1.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">{trajectory} 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="none0.prompt1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="none0.prompt1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="none0.prompt1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Please analyze the state sequence and the agent’s instruction. Identify the index of the goal state. The state indices are 1-based. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span>
<span id="none0.prompt1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<span id="none0.prompt1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="none0.prompt1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">OUTPUT FORMAT:<span id="none0.prompt1.p4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">Answer in a json format as follows: 
<br class="ltx_break">’reasoning’: Explain your reasoning for choosing the goal state(s). 
<br class="ltx_break">’goal_state_indexes’: A list of integers representing the 1-based index of the goal state(s), or -1 if no goal state is present.
</span></span></span>
</span></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="none0.prompt1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">List of Prompts 0.1</span> </span><span id="none0.prompt1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The prompt for identifying the goal state(s) within a trajectory using a given reward function.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="none0.prompt2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_prompt ltx_framed ltx_framed_top"><span id="none0.prompt2.3" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_center ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom">
<span id="none0.prompt2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="none0.prompt2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="none0.prompt2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">You are an ML engineer writing reward functions for RL training. Given a trajectory with marked goal states, create a Python reward function that can reproduce this behavior. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span>
<span id="none0.prompt2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="none0.prompt2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="none0.prompt2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Requirements:<span id="none0.prompt2.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Write self-contained Python 3.9 code
</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Always return rewards &gt;= 0
</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
