<br class="ltx_break"><span id="none0.prompt4.p5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CRITICAL: Incorrectly Shaped Trajectories</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">The reward function above is not shaped optimally on the following trajectories. This is an expert trajectory, so the reward should monotonically increase from one state to the next. The predicted rewards for each step are shown. 
<br class="ltx_break">Change the reward function to fix these errors. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
